,{"children":"Technical data automatically received by the hosting environment: IP address, browser type, device/OS signals, referring URL, and request timestamps (typical web-server or platform logs)."}],["$","li","2. Information we collect-li-2",{"children":"Communication content if you email us directly at the published contact address."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"legal-doc__note","children":"We do not require account registration, and we do not intentionally collect sensitive personal data (such as government IDs, health, or payment card details) through this site."}]]}],["$","$Le","3. How we use information",{"as":"article","className":"legal-doc__block","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. How we use information"}],[["$","p","3. How we use information-p-0",{"children":"Personal information from the contact form or email is used to:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","3. How we use information-li-0",{"children":"Respond to enquiries about projects, architecture, AI/automation, or professional opportunities."}],["$","li","3. How we use information-li-1",{"children":"Send a confirmation that your message was received (when email delivery is configured)."}],["$","li","3. How we use information-li-2",{"children":"Maintain basic security, abuse prevention, and operational reliability of the site."}],["$","li","3. How we use information-li-3",{"children":"Improve clarity of portfolio content over time based on the types of questions received (in aggregate, not for advertising profiles)."}]]}],null]}],["$","$Le","4. Portfolio content and professional work",{"as":"article","className":"legal-doc__block","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Portfolio content and professional work"}],[["$","p","4. Portfolio content and professional work-p-0",{"children":"Case studies, project summaries, industry experience, and technology write-ups describe professional work at a high level. They are intended to communicate skills and approach across industries and stacks — not to publish confidential client records or private personal data of third parties."}],"$Lf"],null,null]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"],"$L17"]}]}]],null,"$L18"]}]
